  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward if sentiment is neutral or negative (0.00) and model shows upward bias, especially after recent spikes.",
    "Reduce forecast overshoots following sharp price spikes (e.g., >70.00) by 5-10% in the next 5-7 days to avoid overcorrection.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias: if 30-day forecast is >75.00 and true outcome is <72.00, reduce forecast by 2-5% for next 10 days.",
    "If sentiment history shows a 0.33 (positive signal) but forecast is below true outcome, increase forecast by 1-3% to align with sentiment momentum.",
    "For horizon >14 days, reduce forecast slope if recent 7-day true outcome shows downward trend, to avoid lagged overreaction."
  ]
}
